# Canonical starting puzzle: every executable byte is a literal binary token.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111000 00000001 00000000 # instruction | MOV AX,1 | One minus one cannot demonstrate unsigned borrow.
00101101 00000001 00000000 # instruction | SUB AX,1 | 2D subtracts one and updates arithmetic flags.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop with AX=0 and CF clear.
